			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=16016&amp;sid=e54f1202f1299d3082712a73041d9873#16016"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Nov 04, 2002 9:18 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=16016&amp;sid=e54f1202f1299d3082712a73041d9873"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Nabastin starts wandering around the area, curious as gnomes are, and see a big beautiful building in front of him. Walking up, his interest piqued, he tries the door. "Hmmm" he thinks to himself "Its locked. Wonder how I can get in."
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
 
<br />
Nabastin
<br />

<br />
Loyal Paladin of Brell Serilis
<br />

<br />
Tyro of Concordat Angelis
<br />

<br />
Druzzil Ro Server of Everquest
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Brell Serilis has given me the duty and power to protect the earth. The earth shall protect me in return.&quot;<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
